# Candidate D: make both final-compression FastTwoSums general TwoSums, then
# apply a top-down three-pair cleanup. No input ordering assumptions.

variable b
variable a1
variable a2
variable a3

# Cancellation-safe six-operation compression: all general TwoSum.
two_sum b a1
two_sum a1 a2
two_sum a2 a3
two_sum b a1
two_sum a1 a2
two_sum a2 a3

# Top-down cleanup.
two_sum b a1
two_sum a1 a2
two_sum a2 a3

prove b strongly_dominates a1
prove a1 strongly_dominates a2
prove a2 strongly_dominates a3
